</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We use special symbols ①,②, and ③ in the outputs generated by GPT-4o to facilitate the extraction of final judgements.</p>
</div>
